        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical match-3 adventure in <i>Avalon Jewels</i>! Step into the mystical world of Avalon, where nature and magic coexist in harmony. Dark clouds have begun to gather, spreading anxiety among the people. The evil wizard has left the Dark Tower, bringing dark creatures that now lurk in the forests, threatening the peace of Avalon. <br> <br>Join Merlin's apprentice on a quest to restore tranquility using the power of Avalon Jewels. Play through 250 captivating levels, each filled with stunning graphics and enchanting quests. Use your magic skills to match jewels, collect Super Gems and Rainbow Gems, and overcome challenging obstacles. Choose your pace in Relaxed Mode or go for a challenge in Puzzle Mode.  <br> <br>Are you the hero Avalon needs? Dive into <i>Avalon Jewels</i>, where every match brings you closer to saving the realm. Experience the perfect blend of relaxation and challenge, making it a must-play for match-3 fans. Begin your magical journey in <i>Avalon Jewels </i>today and become the hero who will save the land from darkness!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250 challenging and fun match-3 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat 10 unique monsters on your quest to save Avalon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your pace in Relaxed Mode or go for a challenge in Puzzle Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and fun to play, yet challenging to fully master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning graphics that bring the magic of Avalon to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player reviews:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERY ADDICTIVE! I keep saying to myself 'just a few more' and, before I know it, 30 more minutes have passed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful game! A very pleasant, easy flowing game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jewels and weapons to collect and monsters to deal with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it wrong to be in love with a game?<br>For me, this is perfect. Clear graphics, some fun side games...roll the dice or spin the wheel, relaxed mode is just that...and there are some great &quot;explosions&quot;. And the dragons!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am in love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loving the Challenge!<br>One of my favorite games from this developer. I hope to see more in the future. Game is challenging enough without being frustrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like very relaxed Match 3 games, this is for you. LOTS of levels to play and easy paced. I'm really enjoying the game and glad I purchased it.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a magical match-3 adventure in <i>Avalon Jewels</i>! Step into the mystical world of Avalon, where nature and magic coexist in harmony. Dark clouds have begun to gather, spreading anxiety among the people. The evil wizard has left the Dark Tower, bringing dark creatures that now lurk in the forests, threatening the peace of Avalon. <br> <br>Join Merlin's apprentice on a quest to restore tranquility using the power of Avalon Jewels. Play through 250 captivating levels, each filled with stunning graphics and enchanting quests. Use your magic skills to match jewels, collect Super Gems and Rainbow Gems, and overcome challenging obstacles. Choose your pace in Relaxed Mode or go for a challenge in Puzzle Mode.  <br> <br>Are you the hero Avalon needs? Dive into <i>Avalon Jewels</i>, where every match brings you closer to saving the realm. Experience the perfect blend of relaxation and challenge, making it a must-play for match-3 fans. Begin your magical journey in <i>Avalon Jewels </i>today and become the hero who will save the land from darkness!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250 challenging and fun match-3 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat 10 unique monsters on your quest to save Avalon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your pace in Relaxed Mode or go for a challenge in Puzzle Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy and fun to play, yet challenging to fully master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stunning graphics that bring the magic of Avalon to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player reviews:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VERY ADDICTIVE! I keep saying to myself 'just a few more' and, before I know it, 30 more minutes have passed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful game! A very pleasant, easy flowing game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of jewels and weapons to collect and monsters to deal with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it wrong to be in love with a game?<br>For me, this is perfect. Clear graphics, some fun side games...roll the dice or spin the wheel, relaxed mode is just that...and there are some great &quot;explosions&quot;. And the dragons!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am in love!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loving the Challenge!<br>One of my favorite games from this developer. I hope to see more in the future. Game is challenging enough without being frustrated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like very relaxed Match 3 games, this is for you. LOTS of levels to play and easy paced. I'm really enjoying the game and glad I purchased it.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Explore Avalon in this enchanting match-3 puzzle game! Solve 250+ levels, create Rainbow Gems, battle unique foes, and journey through magical lands. Relax at your pace or test your skills in Puzzle Mode.",
